Package: qore-oracle-module
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-oracle-module-doc
Description: Oracle database driver and extensions for Qore
 This package provides the native Oracle DBI driver, source and compiled
 OracleExtensions module, and compiler metadata. It supports transactions,
 prepared statements, named types, large objects, Advanced Queuing and native
 bulk loading through Oracle Instant Client. No database server is installed.

